        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kamalaka khuloondekhana khukobola ne chikhabi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Luno ese namueleesie enywe burobosi akari we chikhabi ne silaamo. Nga bibiindu bino bioosi ne bikhabe ne bimwekholekhekho mala mumenye mu kholo nimwo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe akhamusalanisiamo, khebulila kamakhuwa kano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe nende be lisaaye lienywe mukhakobolele Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe, mala mukhamurie niye ne kumwoyo kwenywe kwoosi ne liiba lienywe lioosi. Mukhare kamalaka kewe niko ese ndikho muelesia enywe endaalo yino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma wako, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe akhamukholele enywe siisa. Akhamukobosie murure mu kholo nimwo aamusalanisiamo, lundi akhamukhole enywe mube baiinda lundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aakhaba ne mwasalanisibwa mu sibala sie aleeyi, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe akhamubuusie enywe alala mala amukobosie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio amureere enywe mu sibala nimwo bakukawenywe bamenyanga khale mala alamukhola mube baiinda lukali lundi bakali khukhila bakuukawenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe akhamuelesie enywe kimiooyo kie liiria, nio mu musiime niye ne kumwoyo kwenywe kwoosi ne liiba lienywe lioosi mala muchiililile khumenya mu sibala esio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhakobosie bilaamo bino bioosi khu benywe basiku, babamubiila enywe ne khumupia enywe siibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe mukharie Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne khuloonda kamalaka kewe koosi niko ese ndikho muelesia enywe endaalo yino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe akhamukhole enywe muindiaale mu bioosi nibio mukhola, muliba ne babaana bakali, ne chikhaafu chingali, ne kimikuunda kienywe kikhamemo bibiaamo bikali lukali. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe akhasangaale khumukhola enywe baiinda nga aakhola bakuukawenywe baaba baiinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakhabe kario mwaba ne mumuria niye ne khuloonda kamalaka kewe koosi kakaandikwa mu sitabu sie kamalaka kewe sino. Mukhoya mukobolele Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe ne kumwoyo kwenywe kwoosi ne liiba lienywe lioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lilaka nilio ese ndikho muelesia enywe endaalo yino se lili liaandalafu lukali namwe se lili aleeyi lukali khukhwama khwinywe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.6+ROM.10.7+ROM.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar. 10.6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Se lili mwikulu tawe, nio akhabao oreeba ali, ‘Naanu olacha mwikulu alireere asi khwifwe nio khuliulile mala khulirie tawe?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namwe se lili sikelekha sisiindi sie nyanja nio abeo oreeba ali, ‘Naanu khwifwe olambukha akhureerere efwe nio khuulile mala khurie?’ Tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa lili siimbi lukali ne nanywe. Lili mu minwa kienywe ne mu miooyo kienywe, khwako khe mulirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Endaalo yino ese ndikho muelesia enywe burobosi akari we bulamu ne lifwa nende akari we kamalayi ne kamabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murie kamalaka ka Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe niko ndikho muelesia endaalo yino khulwe khumusiima niye, ne khukhola niko niye eenya ne khuliinda kamalaka kewe koosi. Mwakhola murio, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe alamubiita enywe chikhabi mu sibala nisio muli siimbi khukhwingisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali mwaba ne mulekha Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe mala mulekhe khumuulila, ne eyi musaaya bawele babaandi ne khubakholela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ese muboolela enywe endaalo yino ndi mulabuna. Se mulamenya lukali mu sibala siili engelekha owa Yoritani esio nisio ooli siimbi khukhwingisia tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luno likulu ne liloba bili buloli bwase bili ese ndikho muelesia enywe burobosi akari we bulamu ne lifwa, kari we chikhabi ne silaamo. Khwako robora bulamu nio enywe ne lisaaye lienywe mumenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lir. 12.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.26.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Siima Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe, mu murie niye mala mube basuubilwa khu niye nio mube balamu lundi nio mumenye lukali mu sibala nisio aasuubisia khuelesia bakukawenywe, Aburahamu, Isaaka ne Yakobo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.30.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
